        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is agreed that it is not the intent of the Company to replace Bargaining Unit employees in the ESAC centers with Managers as it is neither desirable nor efficient for Managers to regularly perform routine day-to-day maintenance work operations. However, after the escalation process has been enacted, the managers may perform Bargaining Unit trouble shooting functions in cases where customer service is in jeopardy, ordinarily with a Bargaining Unit Employee available for assistance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                321,
                293,
