        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- A separate skill grouping will be established at the CST and SCST levels for employees assigned to Bargaining Unit work operations at the ESAC Centers. This will involve the creation of new work operation codes and requirements for qualifications as part of the Skill Classification Plan and provisions of Article 13, Paragraph 2(i)(1).",
