            "block_content": "ESAC will be added as a stand-alone system group on present page 155 of CVVA-20. ESAC will be added above 5-ESS for both the CST and SCST titles on present Page 156 of CVVA-20. ESAC will be added above 5-ESS for both the CST and SCST titles on present Page 157.",
